<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,387.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,387.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Feb 5 Reuter - The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,387 today from 1,375 on Feb 4, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1444    13.113	  1436    13.038</p>
<p>   1a   1413 10700.000	  1395 10563.000</p>
